# oxfmt's ignore file (it reads .gitignore + .prettierignore by default — hence
# the prettier name; there is no prettier in this repo). The VSCode oxc
# extension honours it too, so save-on-format leaves these alone.

# captured ComfyUI dumps: fixtures must stay byte-identical to what the server
# actually returned, reformatting them would falsify what we test against
tests/fixtures/**

# upstream ComfyUI-Manager mirrors: refreshed by `bun run gen:manager`, ours to
# store and not to restyle (reformatting turns every refresh into a 1MB diff)
src/manager/json/*.json

# NOT ignored on purpose: src/manager/generated/** — the generator's own output
# is formatted as the LAST step of gen:manager, which is what keeps the ci gate
# green after a regeneration
